cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "若使用本仓库内容，请按下述条目引用。 / If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Mozun · Music Quantification and the Absolute Spatiotemporal Coordinate System"
abstract: >-
  中英双语的音乐量化研究仓库。中文原稿两篇：一篇论证音乐的可量化性及结构层／审美层之分；
  一篇给出音乐事件的绝对时空坐标系（MATCS）及其变拍号闭式、退化性质与事件判据。
  两篇论文均提供英文译本（paper.en.pdf / README.en.md），另有面向 AI Agent 的工程实践文档。
  / A bilingual repository. Two Chinese papers: one argues for the quantifiability of
  music and the structural/aesthetic layer distinction; the other presents the Absolute
  Spatiotemporal Coordinate System (MATCS) with its piecewise closed form for variable
  time signatures, its degeneracy property, and a unified event criterion. English
  translations of both papers are included, together with engineering documentation
  for AI agents.
