references:
  - type: article
    title: "对于音乐“非量化”工作的错位与反思"
    abstract: >-
      Argues that music is quantifiable up to, but not including, the aesthetic layer;
      proposes a layered account of musical quantification. Chinese original with an
      English translation.
    authors:
      - family-names: "Wang"
        given-names: "Zijian"
        alias: "MOZUN"
    year: 2026
    languages:
      - zh
      - en
    keywords:
      - 音乐量化
      - 声音本体论
      - 分层量化
      - music quantification
      - musical ontology
  - type: article
    title: "绝对时空坐标系：音乐事件的精确量化与全局定位"
    abstract: >-
      Presents MATCS: a coordinate system that maps bar:beat positions to a globally
      unique absolute tick under mid-piece time signature changes, with a piecewise
      closed form, a degeneracy theorem, a unified event criterion, and cross-implementation
      verification against REAPER's production time map (82/82 positions agree).
      Chinese original with an English translation.
    authors:
      - family-names: "Wang"
        given-names: "Zijian"
        alias: "MOZUN"
    year: 2026
    languages:
      - zh
      - en
    keywords:
      - MATCS
      - 绝对 Tick
      - 变拍子
      - 事件判据
      - absolute tick
      - variable time signature
      - event criterion
